{
  "description": "Executable definition of the opt-in unicode_compat_v1 profile (the text_normalization config value of the same name): collapse runs of Unicode whitespace (Rust's char::is_whitespace) to one ASCII space, fold the pinned v1 table of Unicode lookalikes to ASCII — curly quotes, the dash family, common Latin ligatures, U+2026; soft hyphen, zero-width space, and U+FEFF erased — and trim. The table is versioned by the profile name and never edited. Generated by `cargo test -p ethos-verify --test normalization_vectors -- --ignored`; never edited by hand.",
  "implementation": "ethos-verify::normalize_quote_unicode_compat_v1",
  "profile": "unicode_compat_v1",
